{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48794","headline":"和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 赵彦伯","name":"和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出豫垂佳节，凭高陟梵宫。\n皇心满尘界，佛迹现虚空。\n日月宜长寿，天人得大通。\n喜闻题宝偈，受记莫由同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}